      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-16T16:19:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per comment in ConnectivityManager, this isn\u0027t really a firewall chain. I think we could remove this, the LOCKDOWN case in changeUidOwnerRule below, and the ConnectivityManager#FIREWALL_CHAIN_LOCKDOWN_VPN constant if we added code to BpfNetMaps to specifically support lockdown VPN rules.\n\nNot for this CL, but maybe add a TODO?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 336,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 336,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "b08654ca0450d021da709a762ab509a8d4f87d40",
