      "writtenOn": "2022-05-16T16:19:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need this check? It looks like the previous code would have crashed if ranges was null, because onVpnUidRangesRemoved or onVpnUidRangesAdded would have iterated over the ranges and that would have thrown an NPE.\n\nIf ranges can\u0027t be null here then I would prefer not to check for null. Not having the null check makes the code easier to read and reason about.\n\nIf the ranges are empty, I think the previous code would have been a no-op. But checking for empty ranges is an improvement because it saves useless work.",
